{#
mail/_message_body.stream.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Swaps one message body for its re-decided self after the reader trusted — or
stopped trusting — the sender.

A replace rather than an update: the images bar, the warnings and the frame are
all downstream of the same decision, and re-rendering the whole partial is what
guarantees they cannot disagree with each other.
#}
<turbo-stream action="replace" target="message_body_{{ message.id }}">
    <template>
        {% include 'mail/_message_body.html.twig' with { message: message } only %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
